The MaPa Rhythm model was trained on data derived from these sources (both CC BY 4.0):

- S3 Dataset: Juan Manuel Espin Lopez, Alberto Huertas Celdran, Javier G. Marin-Blazquez,
  Francisco Esquembre Martinez and Gregorio Martinez Perez. https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.14410229.v2
- UbiqLog (smartphone lifelogging): Rawassizadeh, R. (2013). UCI Machine Learning Repository.
  https://doi.org/10.24432/C55327

Changes to the source data: direct identifiers and private payloads removed; relative time, heartbeat
inference, aggregation, statistical modelling and injected variants. See data-card/.

